    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Reads Unreal string tables (FText::FromStringTable) and follows the game culture. Opt-in: pick it in Project Settings → Tryll Client → Text Provider.</para>
<para>Smart-string formatting is not applied: the table text is sent as authored, so <computeroutput>{}</computeroutput> is not nested inside Mustache <computeroutput>{{ }}</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>A table that is not loaded yet is loaded on first use (blocking, game thread). The language-change signal fires after Unreal has loaded the new language&apos;s text (FTextLocalizationManager::OnTextRevisionChangedEvent), never before. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
